In terms of past references, we have experience working with a national professional order on a regulatory-information assistant project, which is directly relevant to an accounting/audit firm's needs. Additionally, we've worked with a regional council on an assistant supporting social-services case workers and with a mutual health insurer on a claims-handling assistant integrated with their document base. These projects demonstrate our ability to deliver solutions in regulated, document-intensive environments where confidentiality and reliability are crucial.

